{"id":"ebc73c84f81bf776","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-thm-proper.md","title":"Proper Forcing","display":"thm-proper — Proper Forcing","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-proper","aliases":["58-thm-proper"],"display":"thm-proper — Proper Forcing","depends_on":["[[58-df-proper]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]","[[58-df-ctm]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-proper"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-proper</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-proper — Proper Forcing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"58-df-proper\">58-df-proper</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"58-df-ctm\">58-df-ctm</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\Gamma,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal L,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(M,\\Gamma,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal L,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa=(\\omega_1)^M\">\\(\\kappa=(\\omega_1)^M\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\)</span> is the exact countable-transitive-model predicate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal L)\\)</span> is the registered three-place properness formula.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InternalProperForcing}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M;\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\operatorname{InternalProperForcing}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M;\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal L)\\)</span> means that the membership structure of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> satisfies the indicated relativization of that registered formula.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\)</span> is the canonical six-argument forcing relation and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\check\\kappa\">\\(\\check\\kappa\\)</span> is the canonical name.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}internal\\text{-}proper\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\operatorname{InternalProperForcing}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(M;\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal L)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left\\langle M,\\in\\cap M^2\\right\\rangle\n\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(v_0,v_1,v_2)\\urcorner\n[\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal L].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}internal\\text{-}proper\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\operatorname{InternalProperForcing}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(M;\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal L)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left\\langle M,\\in\\cap M^2\\right\\rangle\n\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(v_0,v_1,v_2)\\urcorner\n[\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal L].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}proper}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\n\\land\\kappa=(\\omega_1)^M\n\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal L\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\operatorname{InternalProperForcing}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(M;\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\longrightarrow\n\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\!\\left(\nM,p,\\ulcorner\\omega_1=v_0\\urcorner,\n\\langle\\check\\kappa\\rangle,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}proper}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\n\\land\\kappa=(\\omega_1)^M\n\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal L\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\operatorname{InternalProperForcing}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(M;\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\longrightarrow\n\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\!\\left(\nM,p,\\ulcorner\\omega_1=v_0\\urcorner,\n\\langle\\check\\kappa\\rangle,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Proper forcings preserve the ground model's <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>; properness must be computed inside that same ground model.  External properness of a poset that merely belongs to a countable transitive <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> is insufficient and can even hold for a forcing that collapses <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\omega_1)^M\">\\((\\omega_1)^M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The conclusion is expressed through the registered forcing relation without assuming a greatest condition.</li>\n<li>Many forcings in set theory are proper: Sacks, Cohen, etc.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-proper","status":"resolved","id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-proper]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"911508dbd8495663","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ctm","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ctm]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\Gamma,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal L,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa=(\\omega_1)^M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{InternalProperForcing}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M;\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\check\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}internal\\text{-}proper\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\operatorname{InternalProperForcing}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(M;\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal L)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left\\langle M,\\in\\cap M^2\\right\\rangle\n\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(v_0,v_1,v_2)\\urcorner\n[\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal L].","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}proper}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\n\\land\\kappa=(\\omega_1)^M\n\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal L\\in M\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\operatorname{InternalProperForcing}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(M;\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&\\quad\\longrightarrow\n\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\!\\left(\nM,p,\\ulcorner\\omega_1=v_0\\urcorner,\n\\langle\\check\\kappa\\rangle,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"(\\omega_1)^M","display":false}],"bytes":2297,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4378","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-thm-proper.md|58-thm-proper]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["8935dcac821c0104","911508dbd8495663","66d43bb76d055059"]}